      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Status asthmaticus in children is associated with non-decreasing morbidity and mortality. Oxygen, beta2-agonists and corticosteroids remain the mainstay of therapy. Other therapies may be of help although their efficacy remains anecdotal. The development of new methods of ventilation for children with status asthmaticus is of utmost importance."},
